<refsect1>
  <title/>

  <!-- The informalexample wrapper is only used to bundle the three tags below into a single
       include target; it should not have any formatting effect. -->
  <informalexample id="precedence">
    <para>If multiple root settings are configured, the first one that is set is used, in this
    order:</para>

    <orderedlist>
      <listitem><para><varname>RootDirectoryFileDescriptor=</varname> (the transient unit property set by
      <citerefentry><refentrytitle>systemd-run</refentrytitle><manvolnum>1</manvolnum></citerefentry>'s
      <option>--root-directory=</option>)</para></listitem>
      <listitem><para><varname>RootImage=</varname></para></listitem>
      <listitem><para><varname>RootDirectory=</varname></para></listitem>
      <listitem><para><varname>RootMStack=</varname></para></listitem>
    </orderedlist>

    <para>The other settings are ignored, but still shown by <command>systemctl
    show</command>.</para>
  </informalexample>
</refsect1>
